# §4.9 backups are full REST GET responses. Until a node is converted, its
# parameters still contain the literal CRM x-api-key value -- so these files
# carry a live secret and MUST NOT be committed. They stay on disk for the
# rollback path (§4.10) only.
#
# Plan §1 accepts the key at rest inside n8n. It does NOT sanction copying it
# into a git repo that has a remote.
*-before.json
*-after.json
*-body.json

# Any full REST GET of a workflow embeds the `activeVersion` block, which still
# carries the pre-change literal x-api-key until that node is converted. So ANY
# full-GET dump is a secret at rest. Broaden beyond the specific suffixes above.
*-preflight.json
*-preflight-*.json
*.rawget.json
